# Pinned 2026-10-03 by lane rec187 under panel 187's R1 and R5: a known
# cost, not an intent; a change in either direction turns this case red.
# Defect 182, class (a), adjacent: an operator alone on a line deeper than
# a `match`'s arms is refused, `continuation_outside_brackets`, and the
# block its margin opened is told again, `unexpected_block`; the certain
# deletion, applied, checks clean. Not repaired inline: the line's margin
# is laid out by the lexer before the operator is left out of the stream
# (`sign_above.hero`), in `open_line.hero`, two lines under its ceiling.

function plus_deeper()
    n = 1
    k = match n
        1 => "one"  #~v continuation_outside_brackets unexpected_block
        _ => "many"
    print(k)

function minus_deeper()
    n = 1
    k = match n
        1 => "one"  #~v continuation_outside_brackets unexpected_block
        _ => "many"
